1 C~
COMMANDS TO USE WITH OBJECTS
                 ----------------------------

  GET <object> [container]     take an item
  PUT <object> <container>     place an item into a container
  DROP <object>                drop an item
  GIVE <object> <player>       give an item to another character
  EAT/DRINK <object>           consume food or drink
  FILL/EMPTY <object>          transfer container contents
  EXAMINE <object>             inspect an item closely

Some specialized consumables or devices have their own activation commands.
Use HELP <object type> or examine the item for details.
