1 COUNCIL COUNCILS SENATE SENATOR GOVERNMENT GOVERNMENTS POWER~
The Local Sphere contains multiple governments, councils and independent
organizations. Earth is the principal Human political centre, and The Hague
hosts major interstellar diplomatic institutions.

The Earth Assembly provides a neutral forum for recognized governments and
council representatives, including delegates from worlds that may otherwise be
political rivals. Secure transit links exist to reduce the risk of diplomatic
travel during periods of tension.

Player organizations may have their own leadership structures, ranks,
territories and political relationships.

See also: CLANS EARTH RACES
~

