0 DROP GET GIVE PUT TAKE~
Syntax: DROP <object>
        DROP <amount> COINS
        GET <object>
        GET <object> <container>
        GIVE <object> <character>
        GIVE <amount> COINS <character>
        PUT <object> <container>

DROP places an object or currency on the ground.
GET takes an object from the room or a container.
GIVE transfers an object or currency to another character.
PUT places an object inside a container.

ALL and ALL.<name> can be used where supported to operate on groups of items.

Examples:
