1 MAKEPLASMABLADE "PLASMA BLADE CRAFTING"~
This crafting discipline covers construction of a plasma blade.

Crafting uses an Intelligence-based skill check against a Difficulty Class
appropriate to the design and materials. The character's crafting proficiency,
INT modifier, traits and other relevant bonuses contribute to the check.

See also: CRAFTING SKILLCHECK DIFFICULTYCLASS
~

