101 MAKEREPAIR~
Syntax:  makerepair <mobvnum>
 
Automatically gives the mobile the ability to repair damaged equipment.
Use 'repairset' to set the parameters by which the shop will function.
 
See REPAIRSET, REPAIRSTAT, REPAIRSHOPS
~

