1 NEW NEWBIE START BEGIN~
NEW PLAYER GUIDE
----------------

Begin by exploring your species' orbital academy. The academy teaches movement,
communication, equipment, combat, recovery, shops and basic interaction.

Essential commands:
  LOOK, EXITS, SCORE, INVENTORY, EQUIPMENT, PRACTICE, HELP
  GET, DROP, GIVE, PUT, SAY, TELL, REST, SLEEP, STAND
  CONSIDER, KILL, FLEE

Core rules:
  - attacks roll d20 against ascending Defense;
  - STR governs ordinary melee accuracy, DEX ordinary ranged accuracy;
  - Fortitude uses CON, Reflex uses DEX, Will uses WIS;
  - skill checks use a governing ability and a Difficulty Class;
  - your permanent ability training is limited by Natural Potential.

Eight playable species:
  Human, Vordan, Lethari, Keshari, Pelagian, Drakken, Veyran, Noxian.

Major homeworlds:
  Earth, GJ 273 b, Teegarden's Star b, Ross 128 b, LHS 1140 b,
  Proxima Centauri b, TRAPPIST-1 e and TRAPPIST-1 f.

See also: RACES COMBAT SKILLS TRAIN TRAITS
~

