100 SIZE EQ_SIZE~
Equipment supports four broad size categories:

  small_size  - Veyran, Noxian
  human_size  - Human, Lethari, Keshari, Pelagian
  large_size  - Vordan, Drakken
  heavy_size  - unusually massive equipment and specialist frames

Builders should choose the size flag that matches the intended wearer rather
than using an old species-specific size name.

See also: OSET LAYERS RACES
~

1 SKILLS~
Type PRACTICE to see skills currently available to you. Type SLIST to inspect
skills associated with your advancement path.

Skill resolution uses:

  d20 + skill bonus + governing ability modifier + trait + other modifiers

against a Difficulty Class (DC).

Existing learned values may still be stored internally on a 0-100 proficiency
scale for compatibility. That stored percentage is not itself the success
chance. It is converted into the skill bonus used by the check.

Skill checks do not automatically fail on a natural 1 or automatically
succeed on a natural 20 unless a particular skill explicitly says otherwise.

See also: SKILLCHECK DIFFICULTYCLASS PRACTICE ABILITYMODIFIER
~

101 SLAY SLA~
Syntax:  slay <victim> [immolate/shatter/demon]
 
SLAY kills a character in cold blood, no saving throw.
 
The optional parameters cause different messages to be sent to the actor,
the victim and the room, just for a bit of variety.
 
Slay bypasses auto actions such as autoloot and autosac.  Slay should not
be used to test death_programs on mobs, as it is not the same as an actual
death to the mobile and may not return accurate results.
 
~

