0 SLIST~
Syntax: SLIST
Syntax: SLIST <low> <high>

SLIST shows abilities, skills and weapon proficiencies available through your
advancement path, including current proficiency and advancement limits.

The displayed proficiency value is a progression value. It is not itself a
direct success percentage; task resolution uses the standard skill-check rules.

See also: SKILLS PRACTICE SKILLCHECK
~

101 SLOOKUP~
Syntax: slookup <skill-or-power>
Syntax: slookup all

SLOOKUP shows you the internal 'sn' and external 'slot' for the given skill
or power.  The 'sn' is used for OSET and OSTAT.  The 'slot' is used for area
files.  Neither 'sn' nor 'slot' is used for player files; these operate with
the actual skill and power names.

SLOOKUP ALL shows this information for all skills and powers.
~

