1 "KINETIC SHIELD" "PSIONIC SHIELD"~
Syntax: FEEL "KINETIC SHIELD"

Creates a temporary defensive field. Defensive effects should improve
ascending Defense or grant an explicit resistance rather than lowering an old
Armor Class value.
~

1 "KINETIC FUNNEL"~
Syntax: FEEL "KINETIC FUNNEL" <target>

Manipulates local kinetic forces around the target. The exact effect uses the
